  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">[ODA] Intl subscriptions to the Organisation for Security and Co-operation in Europe Parliamentary Assembly, FYs 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The FCDO pays the UK&#x2019;s subscriptions to the OSCE PA on behalf of Parliament. The subscriptions ensure the running of the OSCE PA and the organisation of its main gatherings, which play a significant role in bringing together parliamentarians from across the OSCE region to scrutinise the OSCE&#x2019;s work and hold governments to account on the commitments they made in signing the Helsinki Final Act in 1975.</narrative>
  </description>
